/E (I followed a Combined Strategy using RSI, SMA and Trend Strategy during my TradingView Paper Trading activity. RSI \(Relative Strength Index\) helps to identify whether the market is overbought or oversold. SMA \(Simple Moving Average\) helps to understand the average price movement. Trend Strategy helps to identify whether the market is moving upward or downward. I combined these methods to understand market movements before making trading decisions. This helped me improve my trading knowledge, patience and consistency.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
